1
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:10,260
NADIA: Mr. Voss, four million dollars left the pension fund last night. I traced it.

2
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:14,520
GRANT: Not here, Miss Okonjo. Smile. The board is watching.

3
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:19,800
NADIA: Then let them watch. The transfer has your approval code on it.

4
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,440
GRANT: Everyone! Our junior auditor has been stealing from the pension fund!

5
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,840
[The music cuts out. A glass shatters on the marble floor.]

6
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:34,380
NADIA: That's a lie! I found the theft, I didn't commit it!

7
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:45,300
SELENE: Ten years of friendship, Nadia, and you rob the people who fed you?

8
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:50,240
NADIA: Selene... you know me. You know I would never do this.

9
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,820
GRANT: Security! Get her out of my building!

10
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,320
[Camera shutters click like rain.]

11
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,400
NADIA: Twenty years of trust. What a joke.

12
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:18,720
THEO: You weren't wrong about the four million. It was only the first transfer.

13
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:23,320
NADIA: Who are you? Why would the IT guy know that?

14
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:29,280
THEO: Because I copied his private ledger before he wiped it. There are eleven more.

15
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:32,520
NADIA: Then give it to the police!

16
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:39,500
THEO: The police chief was at that gala. Server room, before midnight, or the backups are gone forever.

17
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:41,900
[An ominous sting as the tower lights go dark floor by floor.]
